  "review_conclusion": [
    "The W01/W02 protected-air self-lock from FIX01 was corrected.",
    "The submitted 51/51 tests and state checks do not exercise physical crossing at predicate-mismatched contacts.",
    "Every guarded route is reachable while its predicate is false when all exported SHARED/FACE contacts are traversable.",
    "PlannedBarrierVerified therefore cannot be accepted for the current plan."
  ],
  "required_fix": [
    "Use coordinate-first global movement, or prove an equivalent model that cannot firewall routes by label.",
    "Eliminate every incompatible SHARED/FACE contact by rerouting, or bind it to explicit separation/gate geometry.",
    "A SHARED world cell cannot be declared separated without changing the accepted geometry or adding typed state ownership.",
    "Run closed/open state reachability through all exported contacts and all simultaneous gates.",
    "Add production negative fixtures for unconditional mid-route SHARED and FACE bypasses.",
    "Keep the corrected W01/W02 port behavior, protected AIR checks, digest semantics, and prior evidence immutable."
  ],
  "scope_limit": "Static review plus independent re-evaluation of the submitted accepted-envelope model. Unity and Player physics were not executed here.",
